{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run in Fugue Shot presents a series of unique dreamscapes, filled with increasingly difficult puzzles and randomized encounters  to  test your abilities to their limit. Plan your shots carefully to clear the playfield  and overcome the ever-shifting landscape of this liminal and surreal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Own Solutions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up your playfield and test different ideas to destroy bumpers with unique and challenging properties. Interact with a satisfying physics engine and endure the  effects of your strange dreams   to master the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/Untitled-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745003135\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Power Up Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain any of dozens of unique items to impact your run and warp your playstyle.\u00a0Discover powerful synergies to create truly unique builds, allowing for emergent gameplay and a constantly shifting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/FugueShotSteamPageGif2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745003135\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enjoy a Eerily Beautiful World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning pixel art and visual effects compliment a hypnotic and meditative soundtrack to create a surreal, dream-like atmosphere to lose yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/FugueShotSteamPageGif3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745003135\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co